You may play the game for free in a web browser for personal, non-commercial use.
Without prior written permission from Stop60 you may not copy, modify, redistribute,
republish, sell, host elsewhere or create derivative works from any part of this repository.

The board, pieces, glyphs and all graphics are drawn procedurally at runtime (Canvas 2D);
all sounds are generated procedurally at runtime (Web Audio API). No third-party image,
audio or font assets are included. Emoji/glyph characters are rendered by the player's
operating system. Mehen is a historical ancient Egyptian game; this is an original
digital adaptation.

